  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Female leadership course &quot;Strengthening women&apos;s leadership in the judiciary&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This tailor-made leadership development training programme aims to better equip current and potential female leaders to navigate the many challenges and gender biases that hinder female professionals in the judiciary in Jordan.The training programme should be designed to help aspiring female professionals develop the critical leadership skills to influence, persuade, empower, and mentor other women.Those preparing to transition into more senior roles, will be able to deepen their leadership knowledge by reflecting on crucible moments and approaches to challenging situations.The training programme should serve those aiming to overcome gender barriers in the judiciary, and grow both within their careers and organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
